cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ilang-dict, please cite it as below."
title: "iLang Dictionary: the complete vocabulary of the iLang protocol"
abstract: >-
  The complete reference vocabulary for iLang v5.0: 88 verbs in 9 categories,
  13 Greek aliases, 29 core modifiers plus the 20-key media profile, 25
  entities (17 addressable and 8 role) and 32 declarations, including the v5.0
  judgment vocabulary and the v4.1 media profile for image, video and audio.
  The repository ships the human-readable dictionary and a CSV table of the
  same entries for machine use.
type: software
